# Aloe Alchemist: "When this card becomes plotted, target creature gets +3/+2 and gains trample until end of turn" (CR 702.170a, 603.6, 611.2a). Turn 1: Memnite comes down free and a
# Forest and a Mox Emerald pay for Plot {1}{G}; the trigger (from exile) targets Memnite, a 4/3 with trample. At the next turn it is a 1/1 again (the effect ended with turn 1).
# Turn 3: casting the plotted card from exile for free (CR 702.170d) is no plotting: no trigger, no target is asked, and Memnite is not pumped again. The Alchemist is a 3/2 with trample.

